E. Proof consequence
  The visible Res_27/product shell has three mixed buckets, each containing one floor atom and 377 strict local carries.  Cheap-pair existence does not repair the leak.  Paired owner cover counts almost repair it, failing only on AP/Vstar carry(11).  The single extra private-owner deletion bit repairs every checked local carry through weight 3.
  This suggests a concrete no-leak lemma: in the Res_27 fiber, any nonzero local carry that preserves the visible shell must change the paired owner-deletion ledger, unless it belongs to a globally coherent scalar floor lift.
